policy.text:
- Today is Friday 9 October 2026.
- Larkfield keeps a solicitation for a bid when, on its latest amendment wherever read:
- (1) it is active, not cancelled or closed;
- (2) the firm holds the category of its set-aside, or it is open to all;
- (3) the firm does not exceed the size standard of the NAICS code it assigns, on the size record;
- (4) for a services set-aside, the teaming plan on the worksheet keeps the share to firms that are not similarly situated at 50 percent or less;
- (5) a county notice reserved for a group is one the firm belongs to.
- Keeping notifies the bid team.
- No offer goes out without the owner's review.
